  "broader": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/res/7305",
  "definition": "Limits",
  "effectiveDate": "2014-03-01",
  "historyNote": "#6167 eff 1-18-96, EXPIRED: 1-18-04 New. #8127, eff 7-27-04, EXPIRED: 1-23-05; ss by #8532, eff 1-1-06 (from 7306.03); ss by #10532, eff 3-1-14 (a) No person shall obstruct other users of the trail. (b) Foot and bicycle racing shall not be permitted on the Franconia Notch recreational trail, unless permission has been granted by special use permit pursuant to Res 7400.",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
